invariant: INV-14
file: tls.c
catches: webpki_resume_test
reason: the TRUST=webpki tlsi_config_ok stops asking hspost_ticket_age_ok,
  so ch_connect and ch_record_init in that mode offer a stale ticket that
  the raw and ca definition refuses. The two definitions are separate
  functions, so the raw rows do not cover this one; the webpki resume
  rows at each boundary object.

--- old
    return webpki_cfg_ok(cfg) && cfg->buf != NULL && cfg->buf_len >= CH_MIN_RXBUF &&
           hspost_ticket_age_ok(cfg);
--- new
    return webpki_cfg_ok(cfg) && cfg->buf != NULL && cfg->buf_len >= CH_MIN_RXBUF;
